+# Password hashing
+
+No password hashing algorithm is currently recorded as a decision for this project. Earlier conversation excerpts mention both bcrypt and argon2id, but neither was recorded as a decision, and it is unclear whether the later mention was meant to replace the earlier one. Until a decision is recorded, this policy does not specify an algorithm.
